## Golden: `many T` empaquetado y reenvío (0.40.0).
weave total with xs as many int into int:
    var t as int is 0
    var i as int is 0
    while i < xs.len:
        set t is t + (xs at i)
        set i is i + 1
    return t

weave main into int:
    var arr as array of int with size 3 is array of int with size 3
    set arr at 0 is 5
    set arr at 1 is 6
    set arr at 2 is 7
    var sl as span of int is arr at 0 to 3
    calling print with "{calling total}\\n"
    calling print with "{calling total with 1, 2, 3}\\n"
    calling print with "{calling total with arr}\\n"
    calling print with "{calling total with sl}\\n"
    return 0
